claims:
1. An information processing system providing services in cooperation with a cloud system, the information processing system comprising:
a processor which is configured to execute:
an element accumulation processing of accumulating an element displayed in a page for providing a service on the cloud system;
a page-data generating processing of generating a page for a new service by using the element accumulated by the element accumulation processing;
an element-program execution processing of executing a program associated with the element included in the page;
an element generating processing of generating a new element displayed on the page;
a program accumulation processing of accumulating the program for a service corresponding to the element; and
a program generating processing of generating a program for a service corresponding to the new element, the generating being performed by using the program accumulated by the program accumulation processing,
wherein the element includes a dynamic element causing the element's display in the corresponding page to be changed through execution of the program associated with the element,
wherein the element accumulation processing further accumulates the element generated by the element generating processing, and
wherein the program for the service corresponding to the dynamic element is developed separately from the dynamic element, accumulated, and stored, and when the dynamic element is developed, the stored program is selected and associated with the dynamic element such that the dynamic element is operable to provide the service of the selected program that is associated therewith.
